const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"同一个名称是否代表同一个实验？",en:"Does a name identify an experiment?"},body:{zh:"Hou、Xue与Zhang把大量已发表的异象放进统一复现框架。核心问题不只是是否再次得到显著结果，还包括变量定义、股票范围、分组方式与权重改变后，原有解释是否仍成立。",en:"Hou, Xue and Zhang bring reported anomalies into a common replication framework. The question includes variable definitions, universes, grouping and weighting, not merely whether significance reappears."}},{title:{zh:"统一样本，也统一信息时钟",en:"Harmonize samples and information clocks"},body:{zh:"2017年工作论文将CRSP月收益与COMPUSTAT财务资料连接。年度分组使用上一财年的资料；月度分组则区分已公告盈余与其他季度会计项目，后者采用四个月滞后。这个区分承认盈余新闻稿不一定同时披露资产负债表，不能把所有字段都视为同一天可得。",en:"The 2017 working paper joins CRSP monthly returns with COMPUSTAT accounts. Annual sorts use prior-fiscal-year data; monthly sorts distinguish announced earnings from other quarterly items, for which a four-month lag is imposed. Earnings releases need not contain balance sheets, so all accounting fields cannot share an assumed availability date."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w23394/w23394.pdf",label:{zh:"2017年工作论文第3–3.1节：信息滞后",en:"2017 working paper §§3–3.1: information lags"}}},{title:{zh:"微型股为什么影响比较",en:"Why microcaps matter"},body:{zh:"作者通过纽约证券交易所断点和市值加权，降低微型股对比较的主导作用。等权与市值加权回答的对象不同，因此不能只比较结果名称，而不比较样本中哪些公司实际上贡献最大。",en:"NYSE breakpoints and value weighting reduce microcap influence. Equal- and value-weighted results describe different objects, so comparing labels without checking which firms dominate can mislead."}},{title:{zh:"显著性之外还有复现口径",en:"Replication is more than significance"},body:{zh:"论文报告许多结果在统一标准下减弱或不再显著，并讨论多重检验。不能由此推导所有异象都不存在；相反，需要说明什么定义、样本和统计标准产生了什么证据。工作论文与定稿的统计数量也不可混用。",en:"Many results weaken under harmonized standards, with multiple testing adding another hurdle. This does not prove every anomaly absent. Definitions, samples and inference standards must accompany findings; draft and final counts are not interchangeable."}},{title:{zh:"退市处理也属于复现合同",en:"Delisting treatment belongs in the replication contract"},body:{zh:"作者单独说明如何合并CRSP退市收益，以及缺失退市收益的处理。编辑建议：除记录断点和权重，还应列明退出样本的原因、退市回报来源与替代规则。只保留持续上市企业，或者把退市缺失值静默设为零，都会改变正在比较的实验。",en:"The authors document how CRSP delisting returns are combined with ordinary returns and how missing delisting observations are handled. Editorial application: record exit reasons, sources and substitution rules alongside breakpoints and weights. Keeping only surviving listings or silently replacing missing delisting returns with zero changes the experiment."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w23394/w23394.pdf",label:{zh:"2017年工作论文第3.1节：退市收益处理",en:"2017 working paper §3.1: delisting-return treatment"}}},{title:{zh:"回到应计研究重新提问",en:"Return to accrual studies"},body:{zh:"读完Sloan和Dechow–Dichev后，可以用这篇重新检查财务变量怎样构建。本站建议保留原始字段、版本、筛选记录和每一步样本数量，把无法复现的环节当作明确缺口，而不是用相近指标补齐后继续沿用原结论。",en:"After Sloan and Dechow–Dichev, revisit accounting-variable construction. Keep raw fields, versions, exclusions and sample counts. A substituted proxy should be named as a change, not quietly presented as replication."}}],readerLimits:{zh:"导读依据2017年工作论文讨论复现原则；具体清单与检验以期刊定稿为准。未显著不等于证明效应为零。",en:"The guide uses the 2017 working paper for replication principles; consult the journal edition for its final inventory and tests. Insignificance is not proof of zero effect."}};export{e as default};
